// RULES (user): fighters and the tank buy COMMON weapons/armor/jewelry; the tank takes the most P.Def; healers and casters buy the
// REAL armor set for its bonus (Devotion below 40, then healers Karmian / casters Demon's) and Common weapons/jewelry.
// A worn weapon with a Special Ability ("... - Acumen") is NEVER replaced; an enchanted worn piece only by a higher grade.
