  //    Bought when sold in Giran and not worn yet; casters' armor as the real piece (set bonus), everything else as the Common twin.
  //    GEAR PLANNER (2026-10-09): my CLASS's choice per slot (its parent classes', then my role's), alternatives tried in order, buy rule
  //    auto / real / common; nothing obtainable in Giran -> "needs manual: <item> (<where it comes from>)" and, with _fallback 'keep',
