// !clanlevel (clan leader): needs of the NEXT level from Scripts/data/clan_data.json levels (L2J L2Clan.levelUpClan: 1 = 20k SP + 650k adena,
// 2 = 100k SP + 2.5M, 3 = 350k SP + Blood Mark 1419, 4 = 1M SP + Alliance Manifesto 3874 (Q501), 5 = 2.5M SP + Seal of Aspiration 3870 (Q503),
// 6+ = reputation + members). Something missing -> it says exactly what and does NOT travel. All there -> same safe trip as the clan founding
// (P4 control, autolevel stopped), a village master (Kusto/Gesto in Giran) -> "Clan." -> the level-up link (by TEXT; L2Toggle bypasses are
// short codes) -> confirm, the server's answer to Logs/clan.log, every page to Logs/clan_page_*.html, then the clan list again (0x4D).
